      "scope_boundary": "Pulse on nonzero returned branches after factoring the inherited common signed coefficient. Four-return source-role restoration is not an unconditional four-event gate; its completed norm is eta^4."
    },
    {
      "id": "R25.2",
      "title": "The exact feedback memory has four native components",
