      "scope_boundary": "Four-dimensional real two-role continuation closure. Presently invisible skew R feeds future response; this is the explicit source pulse, not a new generic observer theorem or a claim about the entire UGD carrier."
    },
    {
      "id": "R25.3",
      "title": "The full finite-event evolution has an exact retained-memory recurrence",
