      "scope_boundary": "Full finite-event response with every arrival predicate retained and a fixed independent prepared source. Positive matching coefficients arise from joint native evolution, not a stochastic law or reset."
    },
    {
      "id": "R25.4",
      "title": "Completing all returns fixes one exact feedback response",
