      ],
      "scope_boundary": "Completion of the stated arrival-memory feedback, inherited eta strictly below one. Exact operator response, with real quadratic readout depending on source parity/current; no electromagnetic identification."
    },
    {
      "id": "R25.5",
      "title": "All admissible far-boundary continuations give the same limit",
